{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":34204,\"title\":\"Return to Halloweentown\",\"tagline\":\"Unlock The Ultimate Secret This October!\",\"overview\":\"As Halloweentown prepares to celebrate its 1,000th anniversary, Marnie Piper and her brother Dylan return to Witch University, where trouble is in session from the Sinister Sisters and from someone who's plotting to use Marnie's powers for evil.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9lkAYfaaUf46lkXKEWq94wuUs3m.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3bZ382Oh2KBmoax8Z4xOfIaQIC2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"voteCount\":646,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":88,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"David Jackson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":44683,\"name\":\"David Jackson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wkUv3W35SvUJ41UrIeF6wUrV3fM.jpg\"},{\"id\":60072,\"name\":\"Sara Paxton\",\"character\":\"Marnie Piper\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/DWrjFhjSLY4EFanCMKNPrUmP2p.jpg\"},{\"id\":45041,\"name\":\"Judith Hoag\",\"character\":\"Gwen Piper\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q80JiST8vL8Uomgn86lBVoAtafk.jpg\"},{\"id\":67601,\"name\":\"Lucas Grabeel\",\"character\":\"Ethan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tyhpSWU7YDKntONxqC83Ifat2w6.jpg\"},{\"id\":62147,\"name\":\"Joey Zimmerman\",\"character\":\"Dylan Piper\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pS4QNJvQGQSDWpqU50Lq1HH22Hm.jpg\"},{\"id\":94135,\"name\":\"Kristy Wu\",\"character\":\"Scarlett\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qwX6traj8nImnEz51wzmJN0Pqi.jpg\"},{\"id\":91387,\"name\":\"Keone Young\",\"character\":\"Silas Sinister\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hHtr7OzP2I2U7FfA2hj8rPtAt8z.jpg\"},{\"id\":162896,\"name\":\"Millicent Martin\",\"character\":\"Professor Periwinkle\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/thRIWICkmqm1ejtDPrGGbCSeRug.jpg\"},{\"id\":73336,\"name\":\"Summer Bishil\",\"character\":\"Aneesa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/TAN5tk54w5JDtz03gg3BWwOR1C.jpg\"},{\"id\":101778,\"name\":\"Leslie Wing\",\"character\":\"Dr. Goodwyn\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/idxzeGyXOy15BiHVhxnZmuniosv.jpg\"},{\"id\":8857,\"name\":\"Debbie Reynolds\",\"character\":\"Aggie Cromwell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Z9DQqNztKlinANGGgD5dQODtlr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1938679,\"name\":\"Scott Stevensen\",\"character\":\"Dr. Grogg\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1386113,\"name\":\"Katie Cockrell\",\"character\":\"Sage\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sxu9sc1xZk4VGuC7tlgMj1YWq3a.jpg\"},{\"id\":88706,\"name\":\"Kellie Cockrell\",\"character\":\"Saphire\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/VCjJlVbCdIW5KZBAwPhyI6PKPv.jpg\"},{\"id\":550359,\"name\":\"Christopher Robin Miller\",\"character\":\"Young Troll\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eMvNwYW3PnWZRvjASkJCyWZsX8m.jpg\"},{\"id\":180652,\"name\":\"Micaela Nelligan\",\"character\":\"Wrinkled Old Witch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xBNqrh1Mlr7mpiVeiIjJ3LaeMpZ.jpg\"}],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"Halloweentown Collection\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":27850,\"title\":\"Halloweentown\",\"year\":1998,\"rating\":6.8},{\"id\":34205,\"title\":\"Halloweentown II: Kalabar's Revenge\",\"year\":2001,\"rating\":6.8},{\"id\":34560,\"title\":\"Halloweentown High\",\"year\":2004,\"rating\":6.5},{\"id\":34204,\"title\":\"Return to Halloweentown\",\"year\":2006,\"rating\":6.6}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26736,\"title\":\"Wizards of Waverly Place: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vrjLcGBLurVem5lXN8237qz4tyE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qvc6fzE3PzodgJ9no11GlLYZJF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a family vacation, Alex, a young witch, accidentally casts a curse on her loved ones. To reverse this, she tries to find a magical stone while her brother tries to keep their parents together.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21481,\"title\":\"Twitches\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ctDK5B0uR2gre2PxQSSkJZFmh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cu00bZ1hg3Zw9lfDdtMFtvqDTzF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they're witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":92208,\"title\":\"Mom's Got a Date with a Vampire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2c7oXpT7y0Rtwko7vm73zWKyLUn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJe5xph6PxARGmEAYpuf06fFw45.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Hansen kids are in a jam. Adam and his best friend Duffy have gotten their hands on some tickets for the Headless Horseman concert, and his sister Chelsea has a date with her dreamy boyfriend Peter. The only problem is they're both grounded. Chelsea and Adam will do whatever it takes to get their mom Lynette out of the house, even if it includes a chance meeting with a very mysterious man. Everything seems to go according to plan until their little brother Taylor realizes that this stranger might be a vampire.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50393,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda Holiday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJv3pI8pyS13rLjy0ok7a3BiE0a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMR6Mpo8N6JVKbEuxet6N0p1NMA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Winter Feast is Po's favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":177888,\"title\":\"Teen Beach Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sKrGe5EmDSyVaWM0uj7rJDQHRjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKoJTTgpyWiu04hzSgPWbyJfjYi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life's a beach for surfers Brady and McKenzie – until a rogue wave magically transports them inside the classic '60s beach party flick, \\\"Wet Side Story,\\\" where a full-blown rivalry between bikers and surfers threatens to erupt. There, amidst a sea of surfing, singing and dancing, Brady and Mack accidentally change the storyline, and the film’s dreamy hero and heroine fall for them instead of for each other!\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":439058,\"title\":\"Hey Arnold! The Jungle Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/asBhWDiqGxelve0DtMfMFIzR0Jm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eWMHecmPAbOCqALSrq45Jqj4BhF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When their trip to San Lorenzo takes a turn for the worst, Arnold and his classmate’s only hope of getting home is retracing the dangerous path that led to Arnold's parents' disappearance.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":70338,\"title\":\"A Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h94rbv7xBNJUgweD5pMK7cpqwMO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLBMZVAV75my1nFg4JR0fKOu4ho.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The television movie is set in the city of Dimmsdale and centers on the series' main protagonist Timmy Turner with his fairy godparents Cosmo and Wanda and his fairy godbrother Poof. In the movie, Timmy is now 23 years old but is still in fifth grade with his fairy-obsessed fifth grade teacher Mr. Crocker. Despite being grown up, Timmy finds a loophole in the fairy rulebook Da Rules: if he continues to act like a kid, he will still get to keep his fairies. However, the dilemma rises when Tootie, who was once a dorky girl when she was 10 years old, returns to Dimmsdale as an attractive woman. Timmy falls in love with her, a sign that he is growing up to an adult, which means he is closer to losing his fairies. Meanwhile, an oil business tycoon named Hugh J. Magnate, Jr., who teams up with Mr. Crocker, plans to use Timmy's fairies' magic in order to promote his oil business.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":48186,\"title\":\"The Boy Who Cried Werewolf\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i7lny9FF2ylyPDwdF70ImmSbOv3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1tmcsKQo0QzAzpvm1Akmkmxstjq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Californian family inherits a castle in Romania. This is especially exciting to the son, who is obsessed with monsters. And he is not disappointed.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":438747,\"title\":\"Tangled: Before Ever After\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zj82L9maBSW6CAVZltBoFBSuTk1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bAHwlrxTvC37wU86kl4D2QJkMfj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rapunzel grapples with the responsibilities of being a princess and the overprotective ways of her father. While she wholeheartedly loves Eugene, Rapunzel does not share his immediate desire to get married and settle down within the castle walls. Determined to live life on her own terms, she and her tough-as-nails Lady-in-Waiting Cassandra embark on a secret adventure where they encounter mystical rocks that magically cause Rapunzel's long blonde hair to grow back. Impossible to break and difficult to hide, Rapunzel must learn to embrace her hair and all that it represents.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1268,\"title\":\"Mr. Bean's Holiday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSSx9Sq6irWwN9NTQmoT9KE8kXn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yU5jOx10pP6veJW6CLblr6MduHH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mr. Bean wins a trip to Cannes where he unwittingly separates a young boy from his father and must help the two reunite. On the way he discovers France, bicycling and true love, among other things.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ihXBE-mPe5c\",\"name\":\"Return To Halloweentown - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}